sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>EnquiryDetailPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>UpdateEnquiryStatusBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>UpdateEnquiryStatusController
  participant Enquiry as «entity»<br/>Enquiry
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: mark an enquiry READ or REPLIED
  UI->>B: PATCH /api/designer/enquiries/{id}/status (JWT)
  B->>C: updateStatus(Integer designerId, Integer enquiryId, EnquiryStatus status)
  alt backwards transition (to NEW)
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>Enquiry: changeStatus()
  Enquiry->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Enquiry: rows
  Enquiry-->>C: result
  C->>Enquiry: save()
  Enquiry->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Enquiry: rows
  Enquiry-->>C: result
  C-->>B: EnquiryDetail
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end